<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Chat - Multiplayer Games</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
<style>
body::before{content:"chat appen exploderte og beckupen min er hjeme så fixer siden etterpå";position:fixed;inset:0;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:24px;box-sizing:border-box;text-align:center;font-size:clamp(24px,5vw,64px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.15;opacity:.045;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;transform:rotate(-12deg);white-space:normal}.app,.overlay{position:relative;z-index:1}
.soloGame{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:4px 0 20px}.soloHUD{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:10px 0 14px}.soloHUD b{font-size:20px;flex:1}.soloHUD span{padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid #fff2;border-radius:10px;background:#ffffff08}.soloHUD i{font-style:normal}.soloCanvas{display:block;width:min(100%,720px);height:auto;margin:0 auto;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 12px 40px #0005}.soloHint{text-align:center;opacity:.65;line-height:1.5}.numberHero,.typingQuote{max-width:700px;margin:30px auto;padding:28px;border:1px solid #fff2;border-radius:18px;background:#ffffff08;text-align:center}.numberHero input,.typingQuote+textarea{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;margin:15px 0;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #fff2;background:#0003;color:inherit;font:inherit}.reactionPad{display:block;width:min(100%,650px);height:330px;margin:25px auto;border:0;border-radius:22px;background:#252b35;color:#fff;font-size:48px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}.reactionPad[data-state="go"]{background:#25c77a}.memoryGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:9px;max-width:560px;margin:15px auto}.memoryCard{aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid #fff2;border-radius:14px;background:#151b25;color:inherit;font-size:32px;cursor:pointer}.memoryCard.revealed{background:#ffffff12}.mineGrid{display:grid;gap:4px;max-width:620px;margin:15px auto}.mineCell{aspect-ratio:1;border:1px solid #fff2;border-radius:7px;background:#1b222d;color:inherit;font-size:18px;cursor:pointer}.mineCell.flag{background:#303b4d}.cfGrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);gap:5px;max-width:600px;margin:20px auto;padding:9px;border-radius:16px;background:#17233a}.cfCell{aspect-ratio:1;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:#080c13;color:inherit;font-size:24px;cursor:pointer}.typingQuote{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;text-align:left}.typingQuote+textarea{display:block;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 18px}.g3-play{min-height:100%;box-sizing:border-box}
@media(max-width:600px){.reactionPad{height:240px;font-size:34px}.memoryGrid{gap:6px}.memoryCard{font-size:24px}.typingQuote{font-size:18px;padding:18px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="startupScreen" aria-hidden="true"><div class="startup-inner"><div class="startup-icon">🎮</div><h1 class="startup-title">Game Chat</h1><div class="startup-subtitle">Connecting to your games...</div><div class="startup-loader"></div></div></div>
<div class="app"><header class="header"><div class="logo"><div class="logo-icon">🎮</div><span>Game Chat</span><span class="channel"># general</span></div><div class="header-actions"><button class="icon-btn screen-share-header-btn" id="screenShareHeaderBtn" title="Screen Share" aria-label="Screen Share" type="button">🖥️</button><button class="icon-btn" id="gamesBtn" title="Games" aria-label="Games">🎮</button><button class="icon-btn" id="settingsBtn" title="Settings" aria-label="Settings">⚙</button></div></header><main class="messages" id="messages"></main><div class="composer"><div class="composer-box"><button class="games-composer-btn" id="gamesComposerBtn" title="Games" aria-label="Games">🎮</button><button class="attach-btn" id="attachBtn" title="Attach files">📎</button><button class="attach-btn voice-btn" id="voiceBtn" title="Record voice message" aria-label="Record voice message">🎙️</button><input type="file" id="fileInput" accept="image/*,video/*,*/*" multiple style="display:none"><div class="file-preview" id="filePreview"></div><div class="voice-recording-status" id="voiceStatus"><span class="voice-dot"></span><span id="voiceStatusText">Recording 0:00</span></div><textarea id="messageInput" rows="1" placeholder="Message #general · "></textarea><button class="send-btn" id="sendBtn">Send</button></div></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="gamesOverlay"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-header"><h2>🎮 Games</h2><button class="icon-btn" id="closeGames">×</button></div><div class="panel-body"><p style="color:#929aa5;line-height:1.5">Choose a game. Solo Arcade games run locally; multiplayer games use the chat game system.</p><div class="game-grid"><button class="game-choice game-choice-featured games-v3-launch" type="button"><strong>🎮 Open Games</strong><span>Solo Arcade + multiplayer · Search · filters · settings</span><div class="game-players">1–6 players</div></button></div></div></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="settingsOverlay"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-header"><h2>Settings</h2><button class="icon-btn" id="closeSettings">×</button></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="category open"><button class="category-title"><span>👤 Profile</span><span>⌄</span></button><div class="category-body"><div class="setting"><label>Your name</label><input id="usernameInput" maxlength="24" placeholder="Enter your name"></div><div class="setting"><label>Profile picture</label><input id="profilePictureInput" type="file" accept="image/*"><img id="profilePicturePreview" class="profile-preview" alt="Profile picture preview"></div><div class="setting"><label>Device ID</label><input id="deviceIdInput" readonly></div></div></div><div class="category"><button class="category-title"><span>📝 Text</span><span>⌄</span></button><div class="category-body"><div class="setting"><label>Text size</label><input id="textSize" type="range" min="12" max="24" value="16"><div class="setting-value" id="textSizeValue"></div></div><div class="setting"><label>Word spacing</label><input id="wordSpacing" type="range" min="0" max="12" value="0"><div class="setting-value" id="wordSpacingValue"></div></div><div class="setting"><label>Line spacing</label><input id="lineSpacing" type="range" min="1" max="2" step=".05" value="1.45"><div class="setting-value" id="lineSpacingValue"></div></div></div></div><div class="category"><button class="category-title"><span>💬 Chat</span><span>⌄</span></button><div class="category-body"><div class="setting"><label>Refresh rate</label><select id="refreshRate"><option value="10000">10 seconds</option><option value="5000">5 seconds</option><option value="3000">3 seconds</option><option value="2000">2 seconds</option><option value="1000">1 second</option><option value="500" selected>0.5 seconds</option><option value="100">0.1 seconds</option></select></div><div class="setting"><label>Show timestamps</label><select id="showTimestamps"><option value="true">On</option><option value="false">Off</option></select></div></div></div><div class="category"><button class="category-title"><span>🎨 Appearance</span><span>⌄</span></button><div class="category-body"><div class="setting"><label>Theme</label><select id="themeSelect"><option value="dark">Dark</option><option value="midnight">Midnight</option><option value="slate">Slate</option><option value="black">Pure Black</option><option value="blue">Dark Blue</option><option value="purple">Dark Purple</option><option value="green">Dark Green</option><option value="red">Dark Red</option><option value="gray">Classic Gray</option><option value="light">Light</option><option value="oled">OLED</option></select></div><div class="setting"><label>Corner roundness</label><input id="cornerRadius" type="range" min="0" max="25" value="12"><div class="setting-value" id="cornerRadiusValue"></div></div><div class="setting"><label>UI scale</label><input id="uiScale" type="range" min=".8" max="1.2" step=".05" value="1"><div class="setting-value" id="uiScaleValue"></div></div></div></div><div class="category"><button class="category-title"><span>⚙️ Behavior</span><span>⌄</span></button><div class="category-body"><div class="setting"><label>Enter to send</label><select id="enterToSend"><option value="true">On</option><option value="false">Off</option></select></div><div class="setting"><label>Auto-scroll</label><select id="autoScroll"><option value="true">On</option><option value="false">Off</option></select></div></div></div><button class="save-btn" id="saveSettings">Save settings</button><div class="danger-zone"><div class="danger-title">⚠ Danger Zone</div><p>Remove every normal chat message. Game messages are also cleaned up when their games are removed.</p><button class="danger-btn" id="removeEverything">Remove everything</button></div></div></div></div>
<div class="overlay" id="confirmOverlay"><div class="panel"><div class="panel-header"><h2 id="confirmTitle">Confirm</h2></div><div class="panel-body"><p id="confirmText" style="color:#9da5b0;line-height:1.5"></p><div class="game-actions"><button class="game-btn" id="confirmCancel">Cancel</button><button class="game-btn danger" id="confirmYes">Confirm</button></div></div></div></div>
<script src="games.js"></script><script src="app.js"></script><script src="screen-share.js"></script><script src="games-loader.js?v=20260901-v4"></script>
<script src="games-loader.js?v=20260901"></script>
</body></html>
